        <mxCell id="augment_callout" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;Scan &amp; Augment Summary&lt;/b&gt; (shown 1st pass)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;🔎 Scan detected: [missing fields]&lt;br&gt;✅ Augment deduced: field → value (via LLM)&lt;br&gt;❌ Still missing: [fields user must fix]&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Border: &lt;font color=&quot;#FF0000&quot;&gt;red&lt;/font&gt; if still missing · &lt;font color=&quot;#006600&quot;&gt;green&lt;/font&gt; if all resolved · &lt;font color=&quot;#0000FF&quot;&gt;cyan&lt;/font&gt; if nothing was missing" vertex="1"
          style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeWidth=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;spacingLeft=10;">
